% paley1933orthogonal, djokovic1994five, xia2005infinite, djokovic2008orders
% and djokovic2023skew were checked against Crossref, arXiv and the journal
% record on 2026-11-21. The entry for graham2026williamson65 was checked against
% the Zenodo record of its version 1, and the entry for kishan2026notes against
% the repository commit it names, on 2026-11-21. The entries for
% araya2024classification and egan2026recent were checked against Crossref and
% arXiv on 2026-11-22. The entries for sage2026unknown, kishan2026skew and
% epoch2026hadamard were checked on 2026-11-22 against the repository commits
% they name and against the citation the web page gives for itself.
% wallis1970configurations was checked against Crossref on 2026-11-22 and its
% list of unknown skew orders was read in the publisher's text.
% golay1961complementary, cooper1972construction, turyn1974hadamard and
% kharaghani2005hadamard were checked against Crossref on 2026-11-23, and
% sage2026tsequences against the repository commit it names on 2026-11-23.
% The DOI of djokovic2009supplementary was checked against Crossref and
% doi.org on 2026-11-23.
% The entries cited by baselines/skew-matrices.json were checked on 2026-11-24:
% blatt1969skew, szekeres1971cyclotomy, wallis1971skew, spence1975skew,
% djokovic1992construction, djokovic1992skew, fletcher2004new,
% djokovic2014some, djokovic2016class and seberry2017orthogonal against
% Crossref, the last two eprints and the page range of djokovic2016class
% against arXiv; szekeres1969tournaments against the e-periodica page its DOI
% resolves to and against DataCite; passagemath2026combinat against the PyPI
% record of the release. seberry1978skew has no DOI: its journal, volume, year
% and pages 255 to 275 were read from the printed pages of the scan in the
% University of Wollongong repository, whose record gives the last page as 276.
% wallis1971skew was read in the publisher's text for the doubling construction.
% The entries for the propus family at 65 were checked on 2026-11-24:
% balonin2017construction and djokovic2022symmetric against Crossref and arXiv
% (Crossref gives no issue for the second; the number is from the arXiv journal
% reference and the DOI), seberry2015propus against arXiv, and
% kishan2026symmetric260 and kishan2026propus against the repository commit
% they name. The propus arrays were read in the TeX sources of the first three.
% kotsireas2008new was checked on 2026-11-25 against the page of the paper on
% the journal's site and against the first page of its PDF; the journal assigns
% no DOI to that volume. The 8-Williamson array was read in the PDF.
% bright2020williamson and bright2020new were checked against Crossref and the
% arXiv records on 2026-11-25. Both were read in their arXiv versions (v2 of
% each, the accepted manuscripts), not in the publishers' pages: the first for
% its equivalence operations and its table of class counts at even orders, the
% second for its statement that Williamson sequences of length 2^t n exist for
% every t when they exist at odd length n.
% djokovic2025census was read on 2026-11-26 in the PDF that the workshop's page
% of participants links (jenni-paper.pdf): title and authors are from its first
% page, which carries no date, and the year is that of the workshop. Its skew
% section and its list of the 737 odd v below 2500 with order 4v undecided were
% read; the url is the page that links the PDF.
% kline2026skew was checked against the Zenodo record of its version 0.1.0 on
% 2026-11-26. Its README, the abstract of its paper and its list of the primes
% below 250,000 that pass its test (evidence/ratio-scan.txt) were read in the
% archive of that record; the proofs were not.
% wallis1972some and momihara2019constructions were checked against Crossref
% on 2026-11-25. The first was read in the publisher's PDF for its definition
% of type 1 and type 2 matrices and for the bordered array of four
% supplementary difference sets. The second was read in the TeX source of its
% arXiv version 2, which carries the title "Skew Hadamard difference families
% and skew Hadamard matrices" and states the same array; the journal's text was
% not read, and the two are taken to be one paper because OpenAlex lists the
% arXiv record as a location of the DOI and the reference list Crossref holds
% for the DOI matches the preprint's.
% The entries for the symmetric matrices of orders 988, 1036 and 1068 were
% checked on 2026-11-25. djokovic2025census has no arXiv number and no DOI: its
% title and authors were read from the first page of the PDF at the URL given,
% which prints no date, and the date is that of the PDF metadata; the page of
% invited speakers of the Hadamard 2025 workshop lists a talk of this title.
% Its list of 595 undecided symmetric values was read in the PDF.
% djokovic2025orthogonal was checked against the arXiv record (version 1 of
% 2025-08-23, no journal reference) and read in the arXiv PDF.
% kishan2026symmetric and kishan2026exhaustive were checked against the
% repository commit they name, the first through the listing of the folder and
% the second in the text of the section.
% kumar2026good5355 and kumar2026williamson75 were checked on 2026-11-26
