% way on 2026-11-26. seberry1992hadamard has no DOI: its record is the
% publication details on the cover page of the copy in the University of
% Wollongong repository, and its list of skew-Hadamard families and its table
% of the least power of two were read in that scan on 2026-11-26.
% wallis1973note has no DOI: its journal, volume, year and pages are those
% printed on the first page of the scan in the University of Wollongong
% repository, read on 2026-11-26, and agree with the repository record. Its
% lemma on orders m'(m' - 1)(m - 1), with the condition that (m - 1)m'/m be
% the order of a skew-Hadamard matrix, was read on the page numbered 124.
% koukouvinos2008skew and seberry2020hadamard were checked against Crossref on
% 2026-11-26; the subtitle of the second is the one on its title page and in
% Crossref. Both were read in text extracted from the PDFs: in the first, its
% table of m(t) for odd m below 500, where 2^t m is the least order of a
% skew-Hadamard matrix known; in the second, its table of the lowest power of
% two for which a skew-Hadamard matrix is known, for odd q up to 999, and its
% table of known symmetric Hadamard matrices, for odd q up to 399.
% djokovic2025census is a manuscript with no publisher, arXiv or Crossref
